 **Etapa 5: Persistir evidências (F25 checkpoint)**
 1. Salvar `.specs/prd-<slug>/[num]_execution_report.md` (overwrite com `# Generated: <ISO-8601 UTC>` no header — F36) a partir de `assets/task-execution-report-template.md`.
